    "scope": "Pre-registered command-output and programmatic retention pilot, not a live-agent task-success or API-cost experiment.",
    "selection_limit": "The Rust repository is MinifyCLI itself. The two repositories and case frequencies are a convenience sample, not a representative developer-workload distribution.",
    "corrections": "Any preflight correction to argv, adapter support, or an expected status must be recorded before comparative outcomes are collected. Keep original registration and correction history. Do not remove low-savings or failed cases after observing comparison results.",
